e=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Face waves of bots in survival mode. Get points for each bot destroyed and use them to upgrade weapons and unlock abilities. Your choice of weapons at the early stages determines your chances of survival.<br><br><strong>Note: </strong>Rogue bots has a short campaign that can be completed in an hour (excluding survival mode). What the game offers is a shoot-em-up experience packaged with a simple story that aims to give you the feeling of fun through risk and reward gameplay and thrilling encounters where you have to always be on the move and find ways to deal with the enemies. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331410/extras/5d4bffef468688ca251daaafa86d52cd.avif?t=1643226795\" /></div>",
